 see wilson controls these things  called inhibitors which  inhibit the growth of the virus within  their bodies and since he's the only one  who has access to these inhibitors these  soldiers have to do what he says or  they risk turning into mutated zombies  so wilson uses the mad dogs as his  personal covert ops group allowing him  to gain clout within the white house  eventually working his way up to  secretary of defense  just like resident evil 2 infinite  darkness has two storylines one of leon  kennedy  and claire redfield leon has been called  by the president to look into a recent  hack of one of the government's top  secret servers and the president  trusts leon after all it was leon who  saved his daughter which play out in  resident evil 4.  i knew you'd be fine if you landed on  your butt those events occur roughly two  years before that of infinite darkness  player on the other hand works for a  company called terrasave i kid you not  their motto is because  tare doesn't have to end with orist  they're an ngo looking to help build  schools and hospitals in war-torn  regions like panamastan  the last we saw of claire  chronologically was in resident evil  degeneration which is set a year before  the events of  infinite darkness claire wants to get to  the bottom of the mysterious outbreak  that happened in penangstan in 2000  an outbreak she believed was covered up  just like the one she experienced in  raccoon city in 1998.  this gets her tased and tied to a chair  where the big baddie wilson discusses  his entire plan  it's kind of sad to see claire redfield  relegated to damsel in distress when my  experience with her in the games is that  she's a total badass  we never get to see that in infinite  darkness meanwhile leon teams up with  shenmei  and jason who will later find out want  to expose wilson's plan  shenmei's brother was infected with the  virus while working as a soldier in  panama stand  he's currently being held in some sort  of coma state by shenme's wealthy  grandfather jason on the other hand was  a former mad dog's member who can't stop  talking about fear and terror  do you know where the root of terror  comes from terrifying  fear fear fear terror theater fear  fear terror fear terror fear  it's shenme's brother who holds the key  to exposing wilson's plan  every infected mad dog member was  embedded with a chip that recorded their  vitals in combat data  this ties wilson to the infected and is  the proof they need to stop him once and  for all  but jason has tracked down wilson to his  underground lap  and mutates into this creature before  biting wilson  wilson will survive the encounter only  later to be given an inhibitor by that  mysterious company  trisal we know that tricel has links to  albert wesker so it's possible he may be  secretly pulling the strings  jason seems to be a lost cause he thinks  that by showing  everyone what fear is he'll stop  tragedies like the one he  experienced from ever happening  for true again it's the only way  to keep this tragedy from ever happening  again he believes by  exposing wilson it'll shock the world so  that the tragedy that befell him and his  team  as well as penam stan and raccoon city  will never happen again  because it's only through fear that  people will be terrified into action  leon disagrees with this at the end of  the episode in one of the  very few scenes with both claire and  leon claire asks leon to hand  over the chip she wants to send it to  all the newspapers to expose this huge  bioweapon conspiracy  but in an interesting twist leon says no  thanks  bro and this could serve two purposes  one so that leon can handle this on his  own  setting up more seasons of the show and  two to go against what  jason said in the final episode jason  tells leon that  even though jason will die it's too late  leon will help the fear spread  if the news of this bioweapon conspiracy  gets out it's gonna cause a tremendous  amount of fear with world war  implications imagine if china found out  the us was experimenting with bio-weapon  super soldiers right next to its border  on the other hand if leon keeps the chip  and takes matters into his own hands he  can potentially stop that  in essence leon wants to have his cake  and eat it too  he wants to stop tricel and wilson while  making sure the world doesn't panic  and now for a quick 30 second review did  i like resident evil infinite darkness  i don't ever remember being a part of  your crappy script not really i felt  claire was totally underused the  storyline was predictable and the  villains were over the top cheesy but  you know that's kind of the way with  resident evil at least in the games you  have the awesome  gameplay to supplement the story and i  gotta be honest there were times i was  watching this and grabbed my playstation  controller because i thought a boss  fight was gonna happen  the new resident evil live-action show  was just announced i just hope they can  fix some of this writing because this  franchise is so  near and dear to my heart but what did  you think of resident evil infinite  darkness i want to hear your thoughts in  the comments below thanks for watching  everyone make sure to like and subscribe  and for more bad takes you can always  follow me on twitter and instagram  thingstoryt until next time remember  daddy loves you very much
 

